Small pool: \( x + 16 \).  
Big pool: \( 4x + 16 \).  
Given big pool was twice small pool 4 minutes ago:  
\( 4x + 16 = 2(x + 16) \)  
\( 4x + 16 = 2x + 32 \)  
\( 2x = 16 \)  
\( x = 8 \).  

